        "mental",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Creatures other than animals, gremlins, and kholo within 20 feet become extremely unlucky. They must attempt a DC 16 Will save, rolling this Will save twice and using the worse result.</p>\n<p>On a successful save, the creature can't be affected by pugwampi unluck auras for 24 hours. On a failure, the creature must roll twice and use the worse result on all checks as long as it's within 20 feet of the pugwampi.</p>\n<p>Multiple pugwampis don't create any increased effect.</p>",
